description	"Rebel Vanguard

A demoman with a variety of anti armory explosives.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
-- 20% Slower Swings
-- Cripples On Hit
- Stun Baton (Red Style Saber)
-- No Blaster/Saber Defense
-- No Blaster Deflect
-- Staggers On Hit
-- Low (80) Damage
-- 4 Swing Combo
- DL-18 Blaster Pistol (1)
-- Pistol
-- 35%+ RoF, 20%- Damage/FP Drain
-- 25%- Velocity
-- Mag Reload

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcements (1)
- Blast Armor
- 20% Less Knockback Taken
- Strength (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- Environmential Protection (1)

^8Abilities:
- Grapple Hook (1) ^3[CS4]"